# Coding standards

Full spec: `docs/CODING-STANDARDS.md`, templates: `docs/FILE-TEMPLATES.md`.

- `strict` TS; no `any`
- Import order: external → `@/` → relative
- State: localStorage repos + Zustand UI only; no duplicate derived state
- Errors: i18n `errors.*` in UI
- One export per component file; folder name = component name
